{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9fd1f957-4932-8f89-b5f7-d472d29e180b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:08:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Pardon me, is this the right number for trash and recycling questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's me. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my recycling bin is gone. It was at the curb for pickup this morning, and when I went out afterward, it wasn't there. Pardon me, I should say the truck came by early, so I think it went with them, or maybe it got moved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bin missing after pickup. Did you look down the street a little? Sometimes the wind takes them, or the crew tosses them over by a neighbor's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did, yes. I walked down both sides a bit. Nothing. It's the blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blue recycling bin, gone after pickup today. Alright, I'll put in a request for a replacement. Do you want me to take your callback number in case anything's needed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0195. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mike Brennan. B-R-E-N-N-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:07:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Mike. Noted, blue bin missing, replacement requested. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, pardon me, one more thing. When is the next pickup? I want to know whether I'll have the bin back by then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. Since you're on the regular schedule, your next pickup would be in two weeks, given it's recycling and you just had it. Holiday weeks can shift things a day, so keep an eye on the city's schedule page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two weeks, all right. I'll watch for that. Pardon me, I do have to run. I work from home and I've got a video meeting starting in about ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead and get set up. We'll get that bin request moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Kevin. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime, Mike. Take care."
    }
  ],
